Usage: gccli health sleep naps add <start> <end>

Add a nap for today. Garmin takes naps only for the current day.

Arguments:
  <start>    Start time (HH:MM) in your Garmin time zone.
  <end>      End time (HH:MM) in your Garmin time zone. Must not be later than
             now.

Flags:
